== Service Explanation: ==
Alt Magic Pro relies on API calls to our remote servers at [https://alt-magic-api-eabaa2c8506a.herokuapp.com](https://alt-magic-api-eabaa2c8506a.herokuapp.com) for generating alt texts using advanced AI models. Users need to create an account at [Alt Magic Pro](https://altmagic.pro) and obtain an API key to use this service. The services provided by the APIs are listed below:
- Verifying API key for connecting the account to WordPress site
- Generating alt text for the images
- Checking credits usage for the user account created on https://app.altmagic.pro
- Sending notifications to user whenever their accounts get empty and the automatic alt text generation stops


== Data Handling: ==
The plugin sends image data to our servers for processing, which allows us to deliver accurate alt texts. The plugin also fetches credits data from the AltMagic account.
For more information, please refer to:
- [Service Link](https://altmagic.pro)
- [Terms of Use](https://altmagic.pro/terms-of-service)
- [Privacy Policy](https://altmagic.pro/privacy-policy)


